values: [
	'''
	first
	'''# after literal
	"""
	second
	""",/* after escaped */
	''''
	'''
	"""
	''''/* after wider delimiter */
]
after: true

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["key", "values"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["punctuation", "["],
	["block-string", "'''\r\n\tfirst\r\n\t'''"],
	["comment", "# after literal\r"],
	["block-string", "\"\"\"\r\n\tsecond\r\n\t\"\"\""],
	["punctuation", ","],
	["comment", "/* after escaped */"],
	["block-string", "''''\r\n\t'''\r\n\t\"\"\"\r\n\t''''"],
	["comment", "/* after wider delimiter */"],
	["punctuation", "]"],
	["key", "after"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["boolean", "true"]
]

----------------------------------------------------

Comments, commas, and closing brackets resume after a block delimiter. Shorter runs and runs of the other quote character remain block content.
